// Step 5: retry the shade call; it now dispatches to the new method and
// main completes: 1.0 + 0.5 + 0.0.
> :restart retry frame:1
restart:2 retry frame:1: unwound frame:0..frame:1; shade(s: <sphere>, distance: 1.5) dispatches to method:m0@2
1.5

