=== lab: scripted chooser through the structured affordance

// Step 7: no REPL. The same signal is answered by a scripted chooser that
// supplies one typed choice-restart record: 1.0 + 0.5 + 0.0.
$ interloko_lab run --chooser tests/fixtures/break_loop/choices.toml tests/fixtures/break_loop/raymarch.loko
signal condition:0 <bad-sample> value: -0.5, distance: 1.5 at tests/fixtures/break_loop/raymarch.loko:26
  no applicable handler; asking chooser scripted (tests/fixtures/break_loop/choices.toml)
  offered restart:0 use-value(value :: <double-float>)
  offered restart:1 skip-pixel()
  offered restart:2 retry(frame :: <frame>)
  offered restart:3 abort()
  chose restart:0 use-value(value: 0.0) by choice 1
1.5
